<title>UK: Jabil to double staff in Scottish expansion.</title>
<headline>Jabil to double staff in Scottish expansion.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH, Scotland 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida-based circuit board manufacturer Jabil Circuit Ltd said on Wednesday it would double the workforce of its Scottish unit to 1,000 in a 20 million stg expansion programme.</p>
<p>&quot;Incremental floor space allows us to more than double our surface mount and final system assembly capacity,&quot; said William Morean, Jabil's chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Jabil is the world's third largest designer and manufacturer of state-of-the-art circuit board assemblies for use in personal computers, communications and the automotive markets.</p>
<p>-- Bill Magee, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
